sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client
    participant GS as Guardrails Server<br/>8033/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Chunker as Chunker Service<br/>8085/TCP gRPC
    participant Detector as Detector Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant GenTGIS as TGIS Generation<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant OpenAI as OpenAI-Compatible<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over Client,GenTGIS: Flow 1: Text Generation with Detection
        Client->>GS: POST /api/v1/task/classification-with-text-generation<br/>TLS optional, Passthrough headers
        GS->>Detector: POST detection request<br/>TLS optional, Bearer token optional
        Detector-->>GS: Detection results (scores)
        GS->>Chunker: gRPC ChunkText<br/>TLS optional
        Chunker-->>GS: Chunked text segments
        GS->>GenTGIS: gRPC Generate<br/>TLS optional
        GenTGIS-->>GS: Generated text
        GS-->>Client: Classification + Generation response
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Client,Detector: Flow 2: Standalone Content Detection
        Client->>GS: POST /api/v2/text/detection/content<br/>TLS optional, Passthrough headers
        GS->>Chunker: gRPC ChunkText<br/>TLS optional
        Chunker-->>GS: Chunked text segments
        GS->>Detector: POST detection on chunks<br/>TLS optional, Bearer token optional
        Detector-->>GS: Detection results (scores)
        GS-->>Client: Detection response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Client,OpenAI: Flow 3: Chat Completions with Detection
        Client->>GS: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>TLS optional, Passthrough headers
        GS->>Detector: POST input detection<br/>TLS optional, Bearer token optional
        Detector-->>GS: Input detection results
        GS->>OpenAI: POST /chat/completions<br/>TLS optional, API token from env
        OpenAI-->>GS: Chat completion response
        GS->>Detector: POST output detection<br/>TLS optional
        Detector-->>GS: Output detection results
        GS-->>Client: Completions + Detection response<br/>SSE for streaming
    end
